		(property "Source" "NHD-4.0-480480AF-MSXP-CTP.pdf p.5: 1 LED_K, 2 LED_A, 3 NC, 4 VDD, 5 GND, 6 DN0, 7 DP0, 8 GND, 9 CN, 10 CP, 11 GND, 12 DN1, 13 DP1, 14 GND, 15 RESETX, 16 CSX, 17 SCL, 18 SDA, 19 SDO, 20 TE_L, 21 IM0, 22 IM1, 23 IM3, 24 LANSEL. Pad n = panel pin n: the parts face the display, the tail folds back behind the panel, and seen from the front both pin 1 and the footprint's pad 1 are on the left. Hirose FH12-24S-0.5SH(55): bottom contact, 0.30 mm FFC, active (DigiKey listing read 2026-11-10; Hirose's datasheet is not in docs/reference)"
